        "text": "# Shared SSR output\n\n[[toc]]\n\n## Report {#report}\n\n::: tip **Kernel rendering** [Report](#report)\nThis report is rendered by the kernel's offline Deno service.\n:::\n\n| Item | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| Total | **42** |\n| Status | Ready |\n\n```ts\nconst report: { total: number } = { total: 42 };\n```\n\n::: details More information\nReference-style links use the complete document: [VitePress][vp].\n:::\n\n[vp]: https://vitepress.dev/\n\nHTML and template expressions remain text in this demo: `<script>` and `{{ report.total }}`.\n\n> [!NOTE] Shared presentation\n> The outline above links to scoped headings, including explicit `{#report}`.\n\n## Code groups\n\n::: code-group\n```ts:line-numbers=7 {1} [report.ts]\nconst total: number = 42;\n```\n\n```json [report.json]\n{ \"total\": 42 }\n```\n:::\n\n## Change annotations\n\n```ts [changes.ts]\nconst previous = 1; // [!code --]\nconst next = 2; // [!code ++]\nconst selected = 3; // [!code focus]\nconst important = 4; // [!code highlight]\nconst invalid = 5; // [!code error]\nconst caution = 6; // [!code warning]\n```\n"
